  "productSlug": "apify",
  "shortDescription": "Apify is a web-scraping and automation platform built around Actors (ready-made or custom scrapers), compute units, storage, and Apify Proxy. Free includes $5 prepaid usage/month. Starter is $29/mo ($26 annual) with $29 prepaid usage; Scale $199 ($179 annual); Business $999 ($899 annual). Usage beyond prepaid is PAYG (compute units from $0.13–$0.20/CU). Residential proxy from $7–$8/GB depending on plan. Same web-data-collection cluster as Bright Data — different shape (Actor marketplace + compute, not enterprise proxy-first).",
